   "id": "cell-overview-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Project Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "This project performs end-to-end data analytics and machine learning on a real-world hospital appointment dataset containing **110,527 patient records** from Brazil. The dataset tracks scheduled medical appointments and records whether each patient actually showed up.\n",
    "\n",
    "The project covers the full data analytics lifecycle:\n",
    "- **Data Ingestion & Cleaning** — loading raw CSV data, fixing types, removing invalid records\n",
    "- **Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)** — understanding distributions, patterns, and correlations\n",
    "- **Feature Engineering** — creating meaningful predictors from raw columns\n",
    "- **Machine Learning** — training and comparing three classification models\n",
    "- **Model Evaluation** — accuracy, ROC-AUC, confusion matrix, classification report\n",
    "- **Prediction** — using the best model to predict no-show risk for new patients\n",
    "- **Business Recommendations** — actionable insights derived from analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "The complete interactive Streamlit dashboard is available in `app.py` and the ML pipeline is in `ml_backend.py`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-problem-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Problem Statement\n",
    "\n",
    "Patient no-shows — where a patient schedules a medical appointment but fails to attend — are a major operational and financial burden on healthcare systems. Each missed appointment wastes clinical staff time, reduces hospital revenue, and delays care for other patients who could have used that slot.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Core Question:**  \n",
    "> *Given patient demographics, medical history, and appointment scheduling details, can we accurately predict whether a patient will miss their appointment — enabling hospitals to take proactive action?*\n",
    "\n",
    "**Target Variable:** `no_show` — binary flag (1 = patient did NOT show up, 0 = patient showed up)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-objectives-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Objectives\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Perform thorough **Exploratory Data Analysis** to understand patterns in the dataset.\n",
    "2. Identify the **key factors** that predict patient no-shows.\n",
    "3. Engineer meaningful **features** from raw appointment data.\n",
    "4. Train and compare **three ML classification models**: Logistic Regression, Random Forest, and Gradient Boosting.\n",
    "5. Select the **best-performing model** based on ROC-AUC score.\n",
    "6. Provide actionable **business recommendations** for hospital administrators.\n",
    "7. Build a reusable **prediction function** that can score new patient appointments."
   ]
  },
  {
